        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Thespian Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, emotion, mental, occult)\n\n30 feet.\n\nThe muse phantom inspires a supernaturally extreme emotional response\u2014either with biting comedy or bitter drama. Each creature that begins its turn in the aura must attempt a DC 20 Will save; on a failure, the creature is affected as long as it remains within the aura. If the muse phantom is emitting a comedic aura, affected creatures become clumsy 1; if it is emitting a dramatic aura, affected creatures instead become stupefied 1.\n\nThe muse phantom can change its aura from comedic to dramatic or vice versa, or cease or activate this aura, by spending a single action, which has the concentrate trait. A creature possessed by a muse phantom is immune to this aura."
            },
            "id": "3d3bcb76-61cc-4918-864c-898313151c34",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:42.735298"
            }
